/* ===== tx8.js — Writer W7: West Texas & the Permian Basin =====
 Cities: permian (Midland–Odessa), sanangelo (San Angelo), abilene (Abilene), delrio (Del Rio & Seminole Canyon). All region 'west'.
 Characters (NPCS, loc = city): jesse (Permian, 4 stages), walt (San Angelo, 4 stages), ada (Abilene, 4 stages), lupe (Del Rio, 4 stages).
 Stage flags: S.flags.tx8_<npc> = stages done; S.flags.tx8_<npc>_v = visit number of the last stage (next stage needs a later visit).
 Main-plot hooks for the coordinator:
   S.flags.tx8_sand=1          Jesse's bills of lading: Lone Star Sand LLC shipping frac sand to a "San Luís transload" on the cannery road (side evidence).
   S.flags.tx8_jesseWitness=1  Jesse agreed to tell the council/Colleen what he hauled and for whom.
   S.flags.tx8_book=1          Ada's picture book about the shop — can be read aloud at the Santo António festival.
   S.flags.tx8_lupeFest=1      Lupe promised to bring pan de campo to the festival.
   S.flags.tx8_waltBlanket=1   Walt's mohair blanket (cosmetic).
 Dishes: cfsteak (chicken-fried steak, from Walt), pandecampo (pan de campo, from Lupe).
 Perks: dairy ×0.8 (Walt's ranch-wives' co-op), pork ×0.85 (Jesse's refrigerated backhaul).
*/
